OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with bright spells for many
OL,6,Ftoday. Blustery showers continue
OL,7,Facross northern and eastern Scotland,
OL,8,Fwintry over higher ground, with a few
OL,9,Fshowers possible in Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fand later along North Sea coasts.
OL,11,FFeeling cold in the wind.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers linger around coasts,
OL,14,Fmost frequent across northern Scotland
OL,15,Fwhere they'll be wintry over hills.
OL,16,FElsewhere, clear skies allow
OL,17,Fwidespread frost, with a few fog
OL,18,Fpatches possible in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
