OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright with sunny spells for
OL,6,Fmany, especially across England and
OL,7,FWales. Cloudier in the north and
OL,8,Fnorthwest with some showers or rain,
OL,9,Fmainly in Scotland. Feeling cold for
OL,10,Fmost.
